      "body": "These are the verbs and nouns you reach for when you talk about plans, opinions and results — the words that carry a B1 conversation rather than name a thing.\nThere is nothing to draw here, so the line shows the order they usually come in: you weigh something up, you choose, you say why, you make it better, you get there."
